+  ``ETHTOOL_A_PRIVFLAGS_FLAGS``         bitset  private flags
+  ====================================  ======  ==========================
+
+``ETHTOOL_A_PRIVFLAGS_FLAGS`` can either set the whole set of private flags or
+modify only values of some of them.
